---
import { trustPages } from "../data/trust-pages";
import TrustPageLayout from "../layouts/TrustPageLayout.astro";

const page = trustPages.about;
---

<TrustPageLayout page={page} currentKey="about">
  <h2>Technology decisions for small teams</h2>
  <p>
    Choosing software is also a decision about time, money, information, and the
    people who will use it. Everyday Tech Insight helps small-business decision
    makers understand those trade-offs without needing a large specialist team.
  </p>
  <h2>A useful next step</h2>
  <p>
    Each guide focuses on a practical outcome: a shortlist, a workflow map, a
    cost comparison, a recovery plan, or a better question to ask a supplier.
    Start with the <a href="/articles/">guides</a>, explore a <a
      href="/categories/">topic</a
    >, or use a downloadable worksheet in the <a href="/toolkit/">Toolkit</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>How to read the guidance</h2>
  <p>
    Guides combine cited sources with practical analysis. They distinguish
    illustrative examples from observed results and explain where specialist
    advice may be needed. Read the <a href="/editorial-standards/"
      >editorial standards</a
    > for sourcing, AI assistance, and review limitations, or learn about the <a
      href="/publisher/">publication byline</a
    >.
  </p>
</TrustPageLayout>
